"No room in your creel for it (it holds {0} kg).": "No hay sitio en tu cesta para eso (admite {0} kg).",
"Something is still on the stove: let it finish, or take it off first.": "Algo sigue en la cocina: deja que termine, o retíralo primero.",
"Your creel holds {0} kg: not room for everything in the cool box.": "Tu cesta admite {0} kg: no hay sitio para todo lo de la nevera.",
