"Jory Tregear wipes his hands on a rag among the cradles and the smell of resin. “Buying, hiring, or come to look? A day’s hire is a fair way to find out if she suits you.”": "Jory Tregear se limpia las manos con un trapo entre las cunas y el olor a resina. “¿Comprar, alquilar o venir a mirar? Alquilar por un día es buena manera de saber si te conviene.”",
