"{0}: done.": "{0}: hecho.",
"Hand over the buoy": "Entregar la boya",
"Tell {0}": "Avisar a {0}",
"Dougie’s buoy?": "¿La boya de Dougie?",
"Somewhere about here, drifting: an orange float with a flag.": "Por aquí cerca, a la deriva: un flotador naranja con una bandera.",
"{0} is counting on you: {1}{2}.{3}": "{0} cuenta contigo: {1}{2}.{3}",
" (You have {0}.)": " (Tienes {0}.)",
"Favours you’ve agreed to are listed in your journal, under Memories. Nothing is timed: take as long as you like.": "Los favores que has aceptado aparecen en tu diario, en Recuerdos. Nada tiene plazo: tómate el tiempo que quieras.",
"{0} into your purse": "{0} a tu monedero",
"{0} for the shelf at home": "{0} para la estantería de casa",
"a mark on your map: {0}": "una marca en tu mapa: {0}",
"{0}{1}: well fed": "{0}{1}: bien alimentado",
"That’s {0}{1}: go and tell {2}.": "Eso es {0}{1}: ve a decírselo a {2}.",
"You lean out and haul Dougie’s buoy aboard, its rope trailing. Take it in to him.": "Te asomas y subes a bordo la boya de Dougie, con su cabo colgando. Llévasela.",
"the car": "el coche",
"Controller connected, but its layout is unknown: some buttons may be mixed up. Settings, Controls & comfort: Set up the buttons, and the game learns which is which.": "Mando conectado, pero su disposición es desconocida: puede que algunos botones estén cambiados. Ajustes, Controles y comodidad: Configurar los botones, y el juego aprende cuál es cuál.",
