"The kitchen will stock the {0}’s lockers for the voyage: {1} more of food and water, {2}. (Aboard: {3}.)": "La cocina abastecerá los pañoles de {0} para la travesía: {1} más de comida y agua, {2}. (A bordo: {3}.)",
