"The {0}’s lockers are full: {1}.": "Los pañoles de {0} están llenos: {1}.",
"The {0}: {1}.": "{0}: {1}.",
"Iced": "Con hielo",
"The kitchen will fill the {0}’s {1} with ice for the voyage home: three days of it, {2}. (Now: {3}.)": "La cocina llenará de hielo {1} de {0} para el viaje de vuelta: tres días de hielo, {2}. (Ahora: {3}.)",
