"Look closer at the driftwood": "Mirar más de cerca la madera de deriva",
"The fuel pump: fill up": "El surtidor: repostar",
"Open the boot": "Abrir el maletero",
"Get in and drive": "Subir y conducir",
"Sit by the fire": "Sentarte junto al fuego",
"Sit in your camp chair": "Sentarte en tu silla de camping",
"Sit by the stove": "Sentarte junto a la estufa",
"Talk to {0}": "Hablar con {0}",
