", or let her go": ", o soltarla",
", or take her in tow": ", o remolcarla",
"She’s on your towline. Step across into her, or let her go?": "Va en tu cabo de remolque. ¿Pasas a ella, o la sueltas?",
"Step across into her, or take her in tow? (A line from your stern to her bow: she follows where you go.)": "¿Pasas a ella, o la remolcas? (Un cabo de tu popa a su proa: te sigue allí donde vayas.)",
"Take her in tow": "Remolcarla",
"Step across": "Pasar a bordo",
"Battery flat: what now?": "Batería agotada: ¿y ahora qué?",
"She won’t start: look her over": "No arranca: revisarla",
"The helm, or the trolling motor…": "El timón, o el motor eléctrico de pesca…",
