"{0} more to find{1}.": "Faltan {0} por encontrar{1}.",
": follow the coast, the rivers and the trails": ": sigue la costa, los ríos y los senderos",
"in season, plenty coming in": "en temporada, llega mucho",
"out of season, scarce": "fuera de temporada, escaso",
