"Fresh Fish": "Pescado fresco",
"M. Pennock · fishmonger · fish bought from the boats": "M. Pennock · pescadería · se compra pescado a los barcos",
"the slate": "la pizarra",
"the bench": "el banco",
"the lamp post": "la farola",
"the lobster pots": "las nasas",
"the fish boxes": "las cajas de pescado",
"the barrels": "los barriles",
"an upturned dinghy": "un bote volcado",
"the old punt": "el viejo bote de fondo plano",
"the daymark": "la baliza de día",
"the driftwood shelter": "el refugio de madera de deriva",
"Spout Force": "Spout Force",
"the Lower Force": "la Lower Force",
"Calm": "Calma",
"Light airs and a gentle swell. Easy casting and still water in the bays.": "Brisa muy suave y un oleaje tranquilo. Lances fáciles y agua quieta en las bahías.",
"Moderate": "Moderado",
"A good breeze, a few whitecaps and a swell outside; the bays stay sheltered.": "Buena brisa, unos cuantos borreguillos y mar de fondo fuera; las bahías siguen abrigadas.",
"Lively": "Movido",
"A fresh to strong wind, whitecaps everywhere in the open, a long swell breaking on the outer coast. Shelter in the bays and coves.": "Viento fresco a fuerte, borreguillos por todas partes en mar abierto, un largo mar de fondo rompiendo en la costa exterior. Refúgiate en las bahías y calas.",
"N": "N",
"NE": "NE",
